  "description": "A Gemini session whose hook processes run with OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT in their environment (Gemini passes the loaded .env to hooks; telemetry could be redirected): SessionStart still yields exactly one session.started, later hooks map as usual, every hook exits 0 with empty stdout, and the endpoint value appears nowhere (records, spool, batches, ~/.javi). The local warning record itself is not observed here.",
